{"markdown":"### ผู้โจมตี [แก้บิ้ว](https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/build)\n\n![](https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/char/knight_m.webp)\n\n**Knight Lv 60**\n\nATK 1,152 · MATK 6 · คริ 8%\n\n![](https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/char/novice_m.webp)![](https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/char/knight_m.webp)![](https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/char/warrior_m.webp)![](https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/char/scout_m.webp)![](https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/char/rogue_m.webp)![](https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/char/mage_m.webp)![](https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/char/acolyte_m.webp)![](https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/char/summoner_m.webp)\n\nเลเวลเปลี่ยนอาชีพ = ใช้บิ้วอัตโนมัติ\n\nคลาส\n\nคลาส 1AegisSpellbreaker\n\n### เลือกท่า\n\n_1_ ![](https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/item/mace_t8.webp)ตีธรรมดา_2_ ![](https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/skill/bash.png)Shield Bash_3_ ![](https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/skill/slam.png)Bulwark Slam_4_ ![](https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/skill/judgment_blade.png)Judgment Blade_5_ ![](https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/skill/war_horn.png)War Horn_6_ ![](https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/skill/spirit_echo.png)Spirit Echo\n\n### เป้าหมาย เปลี่ยนมอน\n\n![](https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/mob/gale_wisp.webp)\n\n**Gale Wisp** ทั่วไป\n\nHP 13,347 · DEF 0 · MDEF 73 · FLEE 124\n\nLv มอน\n\n🌙 กลางคืนเป้าติดดีบัฟHP ฉันต่ำ\n\nGale Wisp · Lv 61\n\n![](https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/char/knight_m.webp)![](https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/mob/gale_wisp.webp)\n\nกด “ตี” เพื่อลอง\n\n⚔ ตี 1 ที▶ ตีจนตายรีเซ็ตเลขเด้ง = สุ่มแบบเกม (ช่วงดาเมจ \\+ คริ)\n\nดาเมจต่อฮิต (ต่ำ–สูง) **12,311–12,360**\n\nดาเมจเฉลี่ยต่อฮิต **12,336**\n\nโอกาสคริ **0%**\n\nตีกี่ทีตาย **2 ที**\n\nใช้ซ้ำได้ทุก **2.7 วิ**\n\nDPS ท่านี้อย่างเดียว **4,650**\n\nDPS รอบสกิลทั้งบิ้ว **11,863**\n\nฆ่าด้วยรอบสกิล **1.1 วิ**\n\n### 🛡 ถ้ามอนตัวนี้ตีเรา\n\nหลบได้ **20%**\n\nBlock **18%**\n\nโดนจริงต่อที **77**\n\nโดนกี่ทีตาย **118.4**","rawHtml":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"th\"><head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>คำนวณดาเมจ · Binder Town Wiki</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"คำนวณดาเมจ Binder Town: สกิลนี้ตีมอนตัวนี้กี่ที ตายในกี่วิ ด้วยสูตรเดียวกับเกม\"><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/ui/favicon.webp\"><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/\"><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/\" crossorigin=\"\"><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Kanit:wght@500;600;700&amp;family=Noto+Sans+Thai:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/site.css?v=202611171032\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/tools/build.css?v=202611171032\"><link rel=\"modulepreload\" href=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/tools/buildapp.js?v=202611171032\"></head><body class=\"s-dmg\" data-own-keys=\"1\"><div id=\"world\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><header id=\"hud\"><a class=\"plate\" href=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/\"><span class=\"ava\"><img src=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/ui/logo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"></span><span><b>Binder Town</b><small>WIKI · คู่มือในเกม</small></span></a><div class=\"search\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⌕</span><input type=\"search\" placeholder=\"ค้นหาอะไรก็ได้ — มอน ไอเท็ม สกิล แมพ ระบบ…\" data-search=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"ค้นหา\"><kbd>/</kbd><div class=\"results\" data-results=\"\"></div></div><div class=\"hudr\"><div class=\"clock\" data-wb=\"12:30 และ 19:30 น.\">World Boss ถัดไป <b>12:30</b><br><span>อีก 4 ชม. 58 นาที</span></div><a class=\"btn gold\" href=\"https://bindertowngame.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">▶ เข้าเกม</a></div></header><main id=\"stage\"><section class=\"win\"><header class=\"whead\"><div class=\"wt\"><h1><img class=\"px\" src=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/mob/vale_warden.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>คำนวณดาเมจ</span></h1><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/\">หน้าแรก</a> › เครื่องมือ › คำนวณดาเมจ</nav></div><nav class=\"wtabs\"><a class=\"wtab\" href=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/build\">จัดบิ้ว</a><a class=\"wtab on\" href=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/dmg\">คำนวณดาเมจ</a></nav><a class=\"wclose\" href=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/\" title=\"กลับหน้าแรก (Esc)\" aria-label=\"กลับหน้าแรก\">✕</a></header><div class=\"wbody\"><div class=\"dc\"><div class=\"grid\" style=\"gap:12px\">\n      <div class=\"panel\"><h3>ผู้โจมตี <a class=\"r btn xs ghost\" href=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/build\">แก้บิ้ว</a></h3><div class=\"row\" style=\"flex-wrap:nowrap\"><span class=\"tm\" style=\"width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--paper);display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><img class=\"px\" src=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/char/knight_m.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><div><b style=\"font:600 16px var(--display)\">Knight Lv 60</b><div class=\"small muted\">ATK 1,152 · MATK 6 · คริ 8%</div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"jobpick\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"><button style=\"background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink)\" class=\"\" data-job=\"novice\" title=\"Binder\"><img class=\"px\" src=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/char/novice_m.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><button style=\"background:;color:var(--ink)\" class=\"on\" data-job=\"knight\" title=\"Knight\"><img class=\"px\" src=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/char/knight_m.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><button style=\"background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink)\" class=\"\" data-job=\"warrior\" title=\"Warrior\"><img class=\"px\" src=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/char/warrior_m.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><button style=\"background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink)\" class=\"\" data-job=\"scout\" title=\"Scout\"><img class=\"px\" src=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/char/scout_m.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><button style=\"background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink)\" class=\"\" data-job=\"rogue\" title=\"Rogue\"><img class=\"px\" src=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/char/rogue_m.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><button style=\"background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink)\" class=\"\" data-job=\"mage\" title=\"Mage\"><img class=\"px\" src=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/char/mage_m.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><button style=\"background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink)\" class=\"\" data-job=\"acolyte\" title=\"Acolyte\"><img class=\"px\" src=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/char/acolyte_m.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><button style=\"background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink)\" class=\"\" data-job=\"summoner\" title=\"Summoner\"><img class=\"px\" src=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/char/summoner_m.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></button></div>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"margin-top:8px;gap:6px\"><span class=\"small\">เลเวล</span><input class=\"finput\" style=\"min-width:0;width:80px\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"130\" data-level=\"\" value=\"60\"><span class=\"small muted\">เปลี่ยนอาชีพ = ใช้บิ้วอัตโนมัติ</span></div><div class=\"bar c2bar\"><span class=\"small c2lab\">คลาส</span><div class=\"c2pick\"><button class=\"on\" data-c2path=\"\" title=\"Knight\"><span class=\"c2n\">คลาส 1</span></button><button class=\"\" data-c2path=\"aegis\" title=\"สายสืบทอด\"><span class=\"c2n\">Aegis</span></button><button class=\"\" data-c2path=\"spellbreaker\" title=\"สายใหม่\"><span class=\"c2n\">Spellbreaker</span></button></div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"panel\"><h3>เลือกท่า</h3><div class=\"skbar\"><button class=\"skb\" data-dsk=\"basic\"><i>1</i><img class=\"px\" src=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/item/mace_t8.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>ตีธรรมดา</span></button><button class=\"skb on\" data-dsk=\"bash\"><i>2</i><img class=\"px\" src=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/skill/bash.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>Shield Bash</span></button><button class=\"skb\" data-dsk=\"slam\"><i>3</i><img class=\"px\" src=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/skill/slam.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>Bulwark Slam</span></button><button class=\"skb\" data-dsk=\"judgment_blade\"><i>4</i><img class=\"px\" src=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/skill/judgment_blade.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>Judgment Blade</span></button><button class=\"skb\" data-dsk=\"war_horn\"><i>5</i><img class=\"px\" src=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/skill/war_horn.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>War Horn</span></button><button class=\"skb\" data-dsk=\"spirit_echo\"><i>6</i><img class=\"px\" src=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/skill/spirit_echo.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>Spirit Echo</span></button></div></div>\n      <div class=\"panel\"><h3>เป้าหมาย <button class=\"r btn xs ghost\" data-act=\"pickmob\">เปลี่ยนมอน</button></h3><div class=\"target\" data-act=\"pickmob\" title=\"เปลี่ยนมอนเป้าหมาย\" style=\"cursor:pointer\"><span class=\"tm\"><img class=\"px\" src=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/mob/gale_wisp.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\"><b>Gale Wisp</b> <span class=\"tag\">ทั่วไป</span><div class=\"small muted\">HP 13,347 · DEF 0 · MDEF 73 · FLEE 124</div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"margin-top:8px;gap:6px\"><span class=\"small\">Lv มอน</span><input class=\"finput\" style=\"min-width:0;width:80px\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"140\" data-tlv=\"\" value=\"61\"></div>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"margin-top:8px;gap:6px\"><label class=\"chip\" style=\"cursor:pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-cfg=\"night\">🌙 กลางคืน</label><label class=\"chip\" style=\"cursor:pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-cfg=\"debuffed\">เป้าติดดีบัฟ</label><label class=\"chip\" style=\"cursor:pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-cfg=\"lowHp\">HP ฉันต่ำ</label></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid\" style=\"gap:12px\">\n      <div class=\"dummy\" id=\"dummy\" data-act=\"hit1\" title=\"แตะเพื่อตี 1 ที\" style=\"cursor:pointer\"><div class=\"hp\"><div class=\"nm\">Gale Wisp · Lv 61</div><div class=\"barl\"><i id=\"dhp\" style=\"width:100%\"></i></div></div><img class=\"me px\" src=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/char/knight_m.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"mob px\" id=\"dmob\" src=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/mob/gale_wisp.webp\" alt=\"\"><div class=\"cnt\" id=\"dcnt\">กด “ตี” เพื่อลอง</div></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn\" data-act=\"hit1\">⚔ ตี 1 ที</button><button class=\"btn gold\" data-act=\"hitall\">▶ ตีจนตาย</button><button class=\"btn ghost\" data-act=\"hitreset\">รีเซ็ต</button><span class=\"small muted\">เลขเด้ง = สุ่มแบบเกม (ช่วงดาเมจ + คริ)</span></div>\n      <div class=\"stbox\"><div class=\"st\"><span>ดาเมจต่อฮิต (ต่ำ–สูง)</span><b>12,311–12,360</b></div><div class=\"st hi\"><span>ดาเมจเฉลี่ยต่อฮิต</span><b>12,336</b></div><div class=\"st\"><span>โอกาสคริ</span><b>0%</b></div><div class=\"st hi\"><span>ตีกี่ทีตาย</span><b>2 ที</b></div><div class=\"st\"><span>ใช้ซ้ำได้ทุก</span><b>2.7 วิ</b></div><div class=\"st\"><span>DPS ท่านี้อย่างเดียว</span><b>4,650</b></div><div class=\"st blue\"><span>DPS รอบสกิลทั้งบิ้ว</span><b>11,863</b></div><div class=\"st blue\"><span>ฆ่าด้วยรอบสกิล</span><b>1.1 วิ</b></div></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"panel\"><h3>🛡 ถ้ามอนตัวนี้ตีเรา</h3><div class=\"stbox\"><div class=\"st\"><span>หลบได้</span><b>20%</b></div><div class=\"st\"><span>Block</span><b>18%</b></div><div class=\"st blue\"><span>โดนจริงต่อที</span><b>77</b></div><div class=\"st blue\"><span>โดนกี่ทีตาย</span><b>118.4</b></div></div></div>\n    </div></div></div></section><footer class=\"foot\">ข้อมูลดึงจากโค้ดเกมโดยตรง · ตัวเลขตรงกับในเกม</foot